<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-Z WINS PLN 4.4 MLN DEAL.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-Z WINS PLN 4.4 MLN DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Mostostal Zabrze SA won a 4.4-million-zloty contract for the building of an aerial mast in central Poland, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the project would be completed by December 15.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
